---
title: Panels layout
type: doc
---

::summary
The 0.27 panels layout: the CloudSurf app's arrangement as SurfDoc source —
the Navbar rail, a navigator seat plus a pinned Surfy seat, four Desks and
the ten presets. Rendered at 390 / 834 / 1280 to pin the per-class slot set.
::

::app-shell[layout=adaptive desktop=panels tablet=rail mobile=tabs]

